      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74002C0020CE74B098B9ACBE750021003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저, 정말 카나리빵을 줄 거야?\n나중에 딴소리하기 없기야!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n회원 번호 1002번인 나에겐\n그야말로 꿈의 아이템이라구!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800002C0020C815B9D00020CE74B098B9ACBE75C7440020C9040020AC70C57C003F000AB098C911C5D00020B534C18CB9ACD558AE300020C5C6AE30C57C002100100001BE01000AD68CC6D00020BC88D63800200031003000300032BC88C7780020B098C5D0AC90000AADF8C57CB9D0B85C0020AFC8C7580020C544C774D15CC774B77CAD6C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 그렇고, 카나리빵을 가지고 있다니,\n너도 카친인가 보구나!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n보답의 뜻으로 소중한 도구와 교환해 줄게.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC740020ADF8B807ACE0002C0020CE74B098B9ACBE75C7440020AC00C9C0ACE00020C788B2E4B2C8002C000AB108B3C40020CE74CE5CC778AC000020BCF4AD6CB098002100100001BE00000ABCF4B2F5C7580020B73BC73CB85C0020C18CC911D55C0020B3C4AD6CC6400020AD50D658D5740020C904AC8C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 톡톡캔디야!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n전기 기술처럼 짜릿한 식감이\n매력 포인트라구!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
